      or bundled with other software.
   c. Decompile, disassemble or reverse engineer OverLap, or extract its
      source code, except to the extent that the law applicable to you allows
      it in spite of this restriction.
   d. Remove or change the copyright notices, this licence or the third-party
      notices that come with OverLap.
   e. Use the OverLap name or its "OL" icon for anything other than referring
      to OverLap itself. This licence grants no rights to them.

3. Third-party components

   OverLap includes components by other authors (such as Electron, Vue and
